Build a capybara lifestyle goods storefront as a single HTML file (no build step). The shop features 6 inline-SVG products: Yuzu Bath Bombs ($14), Tiny Headphones ($32), Hot-Spring Towel ($18), Zen Pebble Set ($24), Artisanal Grass Snacks ($9), and Lofi Cassette ($12). All product art must be drawn in CSS/inline SVG—no external images.

**Design & Layout:**
- Use a warm, minimal color palette: cream backgrounds, serif display font (Didot/Playfair Display) for logo and headings, teal accents, brown capy tones
- Header: sticky, with **Vibybara logo** (capybara mark + "CapyMart" in serif, italic "Mart"), tagline "Pursue the unbothered life" (hide on mobile), and cart button with item count badge
- Hero: split layout—text left (headline, description), right side shows **Vibybara soaking in a hot spring** with a yuzu on its head
- Product grid: responsive auto-fill layout (280px minimum), cards with SVG art backgrounds, title, short description, price, and "Add to Cart" button
- Cards are clickable to open a product detail modal
- Footer with copyright text

**Vibybara Canonical Art (used for logo, hero mascot, and UI icons):**
Rounded light-brown capybara (#d58d59) with small dark ears (#3a241c), darker blunt muzzle patch (#704939) down the front of the face, serene sleepy eyes (curved stroke paths, never dots), dark nose and mouth (#1e0c0b), soft peachy blush on cheeks. Dark over-ear headphones (#1e0c0b body, #c9a24a band rim) with yellow lightning bolt (#ffd23f) on each earcup. Use this for: header logo (40×40px), hero section capybara (scaled larger), checkout modal icon, and empty-cart icon.

**Product Detail Modal (on card click):**
- Shows full-size SVG art at top
- Product name (large serif heading)
- Short description text
- Extended details text (longer description unique to each product)
- Price and "Add to Cart" button at bottom
- Close button (×) in top right
- Backdrop closes modal on click outside; Escape key closes modal

**Cart Drawer (slide from right):**
- Shows cart items with product thumbnails (small SVG), name, unit price, quantity controls (+/−), remove link, and line total
- Empty state shows sad capybara icon + message
- Footer displays running total and disabled "Checkout" button (enabled only when cart has items)
- Close button (×) or click overlay to dismiss

**Checkout Modal (modal with backdrop):**
- Order summary: lists each item with quantity and line total, shows subtotal, free shipping, grand total
- Discount code section: input field + "Apply" button; supports CAPY10 code for 10% off; shows success/error message and applies discount to total
- Buttons: "Keep Browsing" (closes modal and drawer) and "Place Order"
- After placing order: shows confirmation message with fake order number (CAPY-XXXX format), mentions savings if discount was applied, hides the Place Order button

**Interactions:**
- "Add to Cart" button flashes "Added ✓" state for 900ms, then resets
- Toast notification slides up from bottom when item added, auto-dismisses after ~2s
- Quantity controls update cart in real-time; remove removes item entirely
- Escape key closes modals/drawer with priority: checkout modal first, then detail modal, then drawer
- Smooth transitions and hover effects throughout
